# Nothing and nobody in Russian: ничего́ не зна́ю
subtitle: "Say nobody, nothing and nowhere in Russian with никто́, ничего́, нигде́, никуда́, keep the не that English drops, and answer Ничего́!"
tags: ["russian","negatives in russian","никто","ничего","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/negatives"]
thumb: "band \"Nothing? Say it twice\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Busy and free in Russian: я за́нят","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/88-russian-short-adjectives.cast"}

## Nothing and nobody in Russian: ничего́ не зна́ю
level: basic

    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 860 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 860 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    text k0 "Я никогда́ не хожу́ в кино́." say "Я никогда́ не хожу́ в кино́." x 450 y 600 font_size 56 hidden true
    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 140 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 140 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon balloon_t size 90 set twemoji x 710 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon balloon size 90 set twemoji x 290 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    glossed s1 "Никто́ не идёт в кино́." say_voice b gloss ["nobody","not","","",""] show_gloss under x 500 y 480 font_size 68 hidden true
    text tq1 "кто" #8f887c say кто x 290 y 610 font_size 80 hidden true
    text ta1 "→" #8f887c x 490 y 610 font_size 64 hidden true
    text tn1 "никто́" say никто́ colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 710 y 610 font_size 86 hidden true
    text tq2 "что" #8f887c say что x 290 y 480 font_size 80 hidden true
    text ta2 "→" #8f887c x 490 y 480 font_size 64 hidden true
    text tn2 "ничего́" say ничего́ colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 710 y 480 font_size 86 hidden true
    text tq3 "где" #8f887c say где x 290 y 350 font_size 80 hidden true
    text ta3 "→" #8f887c x 490 y 350 font_size 64 hidden true
    text tn3 "нигде́" say нигде́ colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 710 y 350 font_size 86 hidden true
    text tq4 "куда́" #8f887c say куда́ x 290 y 220 font_size 80 hidden true
    text ta4 "→" #8f887c x 490 y 220 font_size 64 hidden true
    text tn4 "никуда́" say никуда́ colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 710 y 220 font_size 86 hidden true
    text tq2g "чего́" #8f887c x 490 y 535 font_size 38 hidden true
    group table members ["tq1","ta1","tn1","tq2","ta2","tn2","tq3","ta3","tn3","tq4","ta4","tn4","tq2g"] hidden true
    text e1 "Я ничего́ не зна́ю." say "Я ничего́ не зна́ю." say_voice b colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 610 font_size 62 hidden true
    text e2 "Я никуда́ не иду́." say "Я никуда́ не иду́." say_voice b colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 470 font_size 62 hidden true
    text e1g "I don't know anything." #8f887c x 500 y 535 font_size 36 hidden true
    text e2g "I'm not going anywhere." #8f887c x 500 y 395 font_size 36 hidden true

A: You can already say what you never do: я никогда́ не хожу́ в кино́, from lesson eighty-six.
    draw tom tom_name k0

A: Today the same pattern for nobody, nothing and nowhere. Listen (@draw masha masha_name@) first: I ask Masha who's going to the cinema.
    highlight k0 color #c9871a effect underline part "никогда́ не"

    erase k0

A: Кто идёт в кино́?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    hide tom tom_name

    draw balloon

    ask "Who is going to the cinema?" listen "Никто́ не идёт в кино́." voice b options ["Masha and Tom","everyone","nobody"] correct 3 reveal true
        gloss: Nobody is going to the cinema.
        right: Nobody: никто́.
        wrong: Listen to the first word: никто́.

    erase balloon question_1_stamp

    hide masha masha_name

    draw s1

A: Никто́ is nobody: кто, who, with ни in front.
    highlight s1_w_1 color #c9871a effect underline

B: And не stays before the verb. In English two negatives cancel out; in Russian they work together.
    highlight s1_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase s1

A: Кто, who; никто́, nobody.
    draw tq1 ta1 tn1

    highlight tn1 color #2f6b8f part ^ни

A: With что, what, it changes a little: ни plus чего́ makes ничего́, nothing.
    draw tq2 ta2 tn2

B: Say it ничево́: the г sounds like в, as in сего́дня.
    draw tq2g

B: Где, where; нигде́, nowhere.
    draw tq3 ta3 tn3

A: And куда́, where to; никуда́, nowhere, as in going nowhere.
    draw tq4 ta4 tn4

    hide table

    quiz "Now guess: I don't work anywhere. Я … не рабо́таю." voice a
        right: Нигде́: я нигде́ не рабо́таю.
        wrong: Work happens at a place: где.
        * никуда́
        + нигде́
        * ничего́

    show table

A: Нигде́: you work at a place, so it's где, not куда́.
    highlight tq3 tn3 color #c9871a effect underline

    hide table

B: Я ничего́ не зна́ю. Я никуда́ не иду́.
    draw e1 e1g e2 e2g

A: Each time: the ни-word, then не in front of the verb.
    highlight e1 e2 color #c9871a effect underline part не

B: They can even pile up: никто́ никогда́ ничего́ не зна́ет. Still one не.
    text e3 "Никто́ никогда́ ничего́ не зна́ет." say "Никто́ никогда́ ничего́ не зна́ет." say_voice b colors {"^ни":"#2f6b8f","^Ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 320 font_size 54

A: Nobody ever knows anything. In English that's one negative word; in Russian, four.
    text e3g "Nobody ever knows anything." #8f887c x 500 y 260 font_size 36

    erase e1 e1g e2 e2g e3 e3g

A: With no verb, the word stands alone: Что ты де́лаешь?
    text o1 "Что ты де́лаешь?" say "Что ты де́лаешь?" x 280 y 500 font_size 60

B: Ничего́.
    text o2 "Ничего́." say Ничего́. say_voice b colors {"^Ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 770 y 500 font_size 76

A: The others work the same way: Куда́ ты идёшь?
    text o5 "Куда́ ты идёшь?" say "Куда́ ты идёшь?" x 280 y 340 font_size 60

B: Никуда́.
    text o6 "Никуда́." say Никуда́. say_voice b colors {"^Ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 770 y 340 font_size 76

    erase o1 o2 o5 o6

A: And ничего́ also means it's OK, never mind: Извини́те!
    icon o_bump size 140 set twemoji x 230 y 500 or ["pensive face"] icon_look picture of "person bowing"
    text o3 "Извини́те!" say Извини́те! x 450 y 500 font_size 60

B: Ничего́!
    text o4 "Ничего́!" say Ничего́! say_voice b colors {"^Ни":"#2f6b8f"} x 760 y 500 font_size 72
    text o4g "it's OK" #8f887c x 760 y 420 font_size 36

    erase o_bump o3 o4 o4g

A: Now a phone call on a Saturday. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, приве́т! Что ты де́лаешь?","gloss":"Masha, hi! What are you doing?"},{"by":"b","text":"Ничего́. Я никуда́ не иду́, я до́ма.","gloss":"Nothing. I'm not going anywhere, I'm at home."},{"by":"a","text":"Тебе́ не ску́чно?","gloss":"Aren't you bored?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, мне не ску́чно. Я чита́ю. А ты где?","gloss":"No, I'm not bored. I'm reading. And where are you?"},{"by":"a","text":"Я ещё на рабо́те.","gloss":"I'm still at work."},{"by":"b","text":"Ещё? Сего́дня суббо́та!","gloss":"Still? It's Saturday!"},{"by":"a","text":"Да. Никто́ не хо́чет рабо́тать, но я до́лжен.","gloss":"Yes. Nobody wants to work, but I have to."},{"by":"b","text":"Ничего́! За́втра пойдём в кино́.","gloss":"Never mind! Tomorrow we'll go to the cinema."}] show_gloss false practice true size 1.4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q1 size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["bust in silhouette"] icon_look picture of "busts in silhouette"

    quiz "Nobody knows. Which is right?" above q1 reveal.text "Никто́ не зна́ет." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Никто́ не зна́ет: the ни-word, and не before the verb.
        wrong: Russian keeps both: никто́, and не before the verb.
        * Никто́ зна́ет.
        + Никто́ не зна́ет.
        * Не никто́ зна́ет.

    erase q1

    icon q2 size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house

    quiz "Где ты был вчера́? Я … не был." above q2 reveal.text "Я нигде́ не был." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Нигде́: где asks where, so nowhere is нигде́.
        wrong: The question was где, where: ни in front.
        * ничего́
        * никуда́
        + нигде́

    erase q2

    icon q3 size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["pensive face"] icon_look picture of "person bowing"

    quiz "Someone bumps into you and says Извини́те! You answer Ничего́! What do you mean?" above q3 say_answer false reveal.text "Ничего́! It's OK." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: It's OK: ничего́ on its own means never mind.
        wrong: After Извини́те, ничего́ means it's fine.
        + It's OK.
        * Nobody.
        * Never.

    erase q3

    icon q4 size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["house"] icon_look picture of "couch and lamp"

    ask "A friend asks about your plans for today. You're staying in. Say: I'm not going anywhere today." voice a show cue reveal.text "Я сего́дня никуда́ не иду́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        gloss: I'm not going anywhere today.
        say_it: Я сего́дня никуда́ не иду́.

A: Я сего́дня никуда́ не иду́.

    erase q4 question_6_stamp

    icon q5 size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["thinking face"] icon_look picture of "person shrugging"

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I don't know anything." above q5 answer ["я ничего не знаю","ничего не знаю","Ничего́ не зна́ю.","Я ничего́ не зна́ю."] reveal.text "Я ничего́ не зна́ю." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я ничего́ не зна́ю: ничего́, then не before the verb.
        wrong: Start with я, then nothing, then не and know: зна́ю.

    erase q5

    show table

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So Russian says no twice: a ни-word for nobody, nothing or nowhere, and не before the verb.
    highlight tn1 tn2 tn3 tn4 color #2f6b8f part ^ни

    hide table

B: Вот и всё! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "Вот и всё! Пока́!" say "Вот и всё! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: busy and free. Я за́нят.
    box next88 "Next: lesson 88 · я за́нят" say "я за́нят" x 500 y 430 width 600 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

